    "OPEN: calls fail fast immediately (no network hop) for a cooldown period. After cooldown, go HALF-OPEN.",
    "HALF-OPEN: a single probe call is allowed. On success \u2192 CLOSED (reset). On failure \u2192 OPEN (extend cooldown).",
