    "If step N fails, run compensating actions for steps 1..N-1 in reverse order to semantically undo.",
    "Compensations are NOT rollbacks \u2014 they are forward business actions (e.g. refund payment, cancel reservation).",
    "Every saga step MUST define its compensation at design time; a step without a compensation cannot be undone.",
